{"id":"novidades","lemma":"novidades","pos":"noun","rank":2430,"glosses":["news, what's new"],"gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"Tenho novidades.","en":"I have news.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/351413","words":[{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Quais são as novidades?","en":"What's the good news?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1269529","words":[{"g":"which","l":"qual"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Fico feliz em ouvir as novidades.","en":"I am glad to hear the news.","words":[{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"happy"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"to hear"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Eu fiquei surpreso ao ouvir as novidades.","en":"I was surprised to hear the news.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"surprised, astonished"},null,{"g":"to hear"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"O Tom estava ansioso para saber as novidades.","en":"Tom was anxious to know the news.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"anxious"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"to be aware, to know"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}